      "address": "South parking lot, Pacific Coast Highway, Huntington Beach, CA",
      "description": "Public trail access from the south parking lot at Bolsa Chica Ecological Reserve. Designated walking trails and scenic overlooks offer coastal wetland habitat and birdwatching. Stay on established trails; oil-production areas are closed. Pets and bicycles are prohibited. This destination does not include Bolsa Chica State Beach or the separate nature center.",
