      "address": "Big Canyon trailhead parking, Back Bay Drive, Newport Beach, CA",
      "description": "Big Canyon trailhead provides access to a bluff-top trail overlooking the coastal wetland at Upper Newport Bay Ecological Reserve. Hiking and wildlife viewing are supported. Approach via Back Bay Drive, which is one-way northbound for motor vehicles inside the reserve. Observe gate and trail closures. This trail destination does not include the separately scheduled science center, off-site rentals or boat launches.",
